  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GLOBAL SHIELD DFA570-002-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Shield against Climate Risks aims to close protection gaps in climate-vulnerable developing countries, using a tool-box of pre-arranged finance. Following the principles of subsidiarity and ownership of partner countries, the Global Shield applies a needs-based approach and works together closely with local stakeholders to build on already existing financing structures and instruments.&#xa0;The GSSP will work as a service platform and fund within the umbrella structure of the Global Shield to strengthen international climate and disaster risk finance and insurance (CDRFI) architecture, building on country ownership and targeting its support through systematic gap analysis and complementarity with existing CDRFI initiatives</narrative>
  </description>
